[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The BASound mixer tools need the matching kernel module from the
audio/basound port.  Load it at boot in /etc/rc.conf, for example:

    kld_list="basound_hdsp"      # or basound_dice, basound_digi00x,
                                 #    basound_line6, basound_maudio

Device nodes are created as root:wheel with mode 0660.  To give a
non-root user access, either change the device permissions with a
devfs rule, for example:

    [basound=10]
    add path 'hdsp*'   mode 0660 group operator
    add path 'pf2626*' mode 0660 group operator

then set devfs_system_ruleset="basound" in /etc/rc.conf and add the
user to the operator group with "pw groupmod operator -m <user>", or
run the tools as root.
EOM
}
]
